{"title":"Dune Whetstone","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Dune Raider, Sael Quickstring, Dune Skirmisher, Dune Captain</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>What it’s for</h2><p>A <b>gear-line reagent</b>. Each <b>quality reroll</b> of <b>swords</b> uses one.</p><p><b>Dropped by</b> <b>Dune Raider</b>: <a href=\"#/monster/dune-outrider\">Dune Outrider</a>, <a href=\"#/monster/dune-raider\">Dune Raider</a>, <a href=\"#/monster/dune-marauder\">Dune Marauder</a>, <a href=\"#/monster/dune-warlord\">Dune Warlord</a>, <a href=\"#/monster/dune-skirmisher\">Dune Skirmisher</a>, <a href=\"#/monster/dune-blade\">Dune Blade</a>, <a href=\"#/monster/dune-captain\">Dune Captain</a>, <a href=\"#/monster/dune-sandlord\">Dune Sandlord</a>, <a href=\"#/monster/raider-high-chief\">Raider High Chief</a>, about 1 kill in 500 (an elite 1 in 50).</p><p class=\"muted\">See <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging &amp; reagents</a> for the odds and fees, and <a href=\"#/guide/reagents\">Reagents</a> for every reagent.</p>\n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"dune-raider\" title=\"Dune Raider - dropped it in 2 of 25 looted corpses (1/13)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/df6ebb3872ba169f9ab2.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dune Raider</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/13<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"dune-captain\" title=\"Dune Captain - dropped it in 1 of 29 looted corpses (1/29)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/164853a853a7615813df.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dune Captain</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/29<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"dune-skirmisher\" title=\"Sael Quickstring - dropped it in 2 of 300 looted corpses (1/150)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/491a153af36e89ea9f44.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Sael Quickstring</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/150<br>×1</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"dune-whetstone\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/856bbd4f9ab72fa1ff47.svg\" alt=\"Dune Whetstone\"></div><h3>Dune Whetstone</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Dropped by</th><td>3 monsters</td></tr>\n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Last seen</th><td>10/23/2026, 7:58:57 AM</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}